			<div class="content" id="post-content-2693726">
									

<p>Welp, here is my third scip! After 2 months of drafting (and some lack of motivation), it is finally out. For those wondering, this is a start at connecting some the Foundation mythos together, which has always been fragmented. About the Church of the Second Hytoth, they are basically the Daevites but much more benevolent, with a bit of collecting ancient stuff. I don't fully intend to make them of GOI, but if you guys want to do so I won't object at all.</p>
<p>Also if someone can correctly identify every cross reference they get 1 Voltbuck! (Worth 0.0001 US dollars)</p>
<p>Oh, almost forgot! Big shoutout to shaggydredlocks and buttfranklin for helping my write this, and to everyone else who has reviewed it!</p>

